comment2.text=\r\n\ Edge\ detection\r\n\ What\ it\ is\:\ compares\ each\ pixels\ avg\ RGB\ val\ to\ the\ one\ below\ it.\ If\ similar,\ paint\ the\ top\ pixel\ white.\ If\ different,\r\n\ paint\ it\ black.\ \r\n\ @param\ lebron\ picture\r\n\ @return\ edge\ detected\ lebron\r\n
